# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""Ayu Music 1.2: native music library for AyuGram / exteraGram.

Single-file source plugin. No external servers, tokens, packages or message sends.
Music provider and document-to-MessageObject conversion follow Telegram Android's
ChatAttachAlertAudioLayout.searchGlobal implementation. Install on device to test
the Java UI bridge: it cannot be exercised by desktop CPython.
"""

